OL,3,AGerman airport worker dies of malaria
OL,4,Aafter 'mosquito arrives on plane'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Frankfurt Airport worker has died of
OL,7,Fmalaria after a rare outbreak led to
OL,8,Fsix employees contracting the serious
OL,9,Finfection spread by mosquitoes.
OL,11,FIt is believed the mosquitoes arrived
OL,12,Fat Germany's busiest airport on a
OL,13,Fplane, according to German public
OL,14,Fhealth officials.
OL,16,FThe remaining five infected individuals
OL,17,Fare receiving medical treatment, a
OL,18,Fspokesperson for airport operator
OL,19,FFraport said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
