OL,3,AGerman airport worker dies of malaria
OL,4,Aafter 'mosquito arrives on plane'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraps have been installed at the
OL,7,Fairport and mosquitoes captured will be
OL,8,Fanalysed in a laboratory to determine
OL,9,Ftheir species and origin.
